From 27caa4992ffebeb47125cd41914dc776d6cdf008 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:15:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/17] media: amlogic: amvdec: add shared HEVC and FBC support

Add canvas and framebuffer-compression allocation for the HEVC core,
including AM21C capture, MMU page tables and optional DMA guards.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5-1
